<http://data.silknow.org/object/5db7eda7-9865-39b6-8163-f447ef48f596>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Magistrate's robe of crimson satin, Italy, c.1760"@en , "Magistrate's robe of crimson satin, faced with crimson silk taffeta. The 1⅞-inch (4.7 cm) collar is ‘grown on’; the back part of the body of the gown, the front collar in 2 pieces. It has ⅝-inch (1.5 cm) shoulder wings and full sleeves tapering to the wrist below the elbow. The robe is top-stitched around all the parts and hem. There are 8 worked buttonholes at each wrist with corresponding buttons covered with crimson silk thread. There are 25 worked buttonholes at the top of the left front, with a further 50 below, grouped in fives, with corresponding buttons."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/c1e866b9-7259-35a2-905a-ed15708384a0> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/71294da8-bc46-342b-bf92-a6875b357480> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/51c5a514-e841-39ba-9633-ddf462fc9675> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/5e703538-75e1-3857-bb72-a76fc98e6668> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Magistrate's robe of crimson satin, faced with crimson silk taffeta. The 1⅞-inch (4.7 cm) collar is ‘grown on’; the back part of the body of the gown, the front collar in 2 pieces. It has ⅝-inch (1.5 cm) shoulder wings and full sleeves tapering to the wrist below the elbow. The robe is top-stitched around all the parts and hem. There are 8 worked buttonholes at each wrist with corresponding buttons covered with crimson silk thread. There are 25 worked buttonholes at the top of the left front, with a further 50 below, grouped in fives, with corresponding buttons."@en , "Magistrate's robe of crimson satin, Italy, c.1760"@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/5db7eda7-9865-39b6-8163-f447ef48f596/dimension/3> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/5db7eda7-9865-39b6-8163-f447ef48f596/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/5db7eda7-9865-39b6-8163-f447ef48f596/dimension/1> ;
